{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5ffe89ca3222ab16ffa1e41e1e913a29e42b569bd6de210abb213a71f0bfba3d","ja":"ヒートアップ！！","zh":"热力全开！！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c1c1a0ec517f83fcbd9aaf52fa826e8c3078175d2e30bf21ec2af715b7af3cdf","ja":"「乗組員のみんなも、ここにいる星の住民も……\n私が絶対に守る！」","zh":"「船员们也好，住在这颗星球上的居民也好……\n我一定会守护到底！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"18e60e657a354fe0bf17ef8a9cc3ac72ec0ff7ac11c0f1ba3834624194ae72f2","ja":"「随分余裕だな。勝利を確信しているようだが\n……見くびってもらっては困る！」","zh":"「你可真从容。看来你已经确信会赢了\n……可别小看我！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4ae12bd79795151f802e8f4b6f1730bada18c8f0955afd05192c321e74fecd54","ja":"「そうですね。\n私たちの力……思い知らせてあげましょう！」","zh":"说得也是。\n我们的力量……就让他们好好见识一下吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3da4ddad36cf4c7fd2b241b7f4f92bd095c4869fece9569bc289748343d84162","ja":"ワァアアアアアアッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"00f999aed06064a2afc9fbe55a9c32209085d97b8b1127ec3d78e2fa680cd8a4","ja":"（えへへ……お客さんたち、お芝居にすっかり\n夢中になってくれてるみたいだねぇ♪）","zh":"（嘿嘿……观众们好像完全\n沉浸在戏剧里了呢♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a1b61f93ed6fa875852065bbb26db3d030631675cc06a5257dfd981715c9e0f1","ja":"（あとはスタッフさんに合図して、\nみんなをライブ会場に誘導してもらえば……）","zh":"（之后就示意一下工作人员，\n让他们引导大家前往演唱会会场……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"bda116338f6f666829caf5b4e93fe2580f51c6f491b2fe9b81e9f5e5ddcc47d7","ja":"「チハヤとトモカの再バトルだって！？」\n「監獄星のセットの方なのかな？　行かないと！」","zh":"「千早和朋花要再战了！？」\n「是监狱星的布景那边吗？得去！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"cf630fa94db41d511be88a2a4712230ac917dbebf048dd750c405fb52ac50b6a","ja":"えっ！？　あっ、えっと……「ま、待つんだ！\n指示があるまでこの場で待機を……」","zh":"诶！？　啊，那个……「等、等一下！\n在接到指示之前，在此待命……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1efbe0e248c54e9f8ee2c59b2074e23d8a8dbdd59b8f3c2c7acd3fd0968cbeb9","ja":"「乗組員としては、チハヤの援護に行かないと！」\n「あっちの方にいるって！」「ちょっと、通して！！」","zh":"「作为乘务员，我得去支援千早了！」\n「她在那边！」「让一下，让我过去！！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"00d856b058253703155c8253b3bb9a0a508fae7263fe1a44cd7bb8a521ee6deb","ja":"み、みんな、急に走ったら危ないべさ……。","zh":"大、大家，突然跑起来很危险的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"6bef00b3721cd5a1a388f88d81f02923a133adf028ae5d826d64f5398dd4ae6c","ja":"「……全員、静かに！　みんなが動揺してたら、\nチハヤの足手まといになるわよ！」","zh":"「……全员，安静！　要是大家都动摇了，\n就会成为千早的累赘啊！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b4f95dc94a150e9f785590d19fe9e48af3c85463d3a36d0ec35ff48a8015a864","ja":"「ふたりの歌姫の戦いに巻き込まれないために……\n監獄星のシェルターへ移動しましょう！」","zh":"\"为了不被卷入两位歌姬的战斗……\n我们前往监狱星的避难所吧！\"","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e91ef7aa357dffcb2c3e3b299fef7e22b4ed85a2a44c281bfc09f14a76725156","ja":"「私たちと先導員の指示に従って、冷静に迅速に！\n付いてきてちょうだい！」","zh":"「请听从我们和引导员的指示，冷静迅速地！\n跟过来吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6855db1dd58b271a59f5369ad91b8f1ea9eb02842fd21f4bd40c187a149165aa","ja":"「ら、ラジャー！！」\n「えっと……あ、先導員はあの人かな……？」","zh":"「收、收到！！」\n「那个……啊，引导员是那个人吗……？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1237.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"983a34cf4034beca2e19a119faeb0adf0eb08973e08e34772d536e6cb381c511","ja":"（さすがこのみさん！\nみんな、ライブ会場に向かってくれたべさ……）","zh":"（真不愧是Konomi！\n大家都朝演唱会会场来了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
